# server: cloudflare
```

---

### ✅ Private Services (Access)

Open in browser:
- https://argocd.goalixa.com
- https://harbor.goalixa.com
- https://monitoring.goalixa.com

**Expected:** Cloudflare Access login page, not direct service login.

---

### ✅ kubectl (WARP)

```bash
# Connect WARP
warp-cli connect

# Test kubectl
kubectl get nodes

# Should work! Verify in Gateway logs.
```

---

### ✅ SSH (WARP)

```bash
# With WARP connected
ssh root@5.75.206.111

# Should work! Check Gateway network logs.
```

