## Configuration Files Reference

### `/etc/cloudflared/config.yml`

```yaml
tunnel: goalixa-cluster
credentials-file: /root/.cloudflared/0cfcc894-5ea2-4a81-996f-72e09488edb4.json

ingress:
  - hostname: goalixa.com
    service: http://5.75.206.111:80
    originRequest:
      noTLSVerify: true
      connectTimeout: 30s
      httpHostHeader: goalixa.com

  - hostname: app.goalixa.com
    service: http://5.75.206.111:80
    originRequest:
      noTLSVerify: true
      connectTimeout: 30s
      httpHostHeader: app.goalixa.com

  - hostname: argocd.goalixa.com
    service: http://5.75.206.111:80
    originRequest:
      noTLSVerify: true
      connectTimeout: 30s
      httpHostHeader: argocd.goalixa.com

  - hostname: harbor.goalixa.com
    service: http://5.75.206.111:80
    originRequest:
      noTLSVerify: true
      connectTimeout: 30s
      httpHostHeader: harbor.goalixa.com

  - hostname: monitoring.goalixa.com
    service: http://5.75.206.111:80
    originRequest:
      noTLSVerify: true
      connectTimeout: 30s
      httpHostHeader: monitoring.goalixa.com

  - service: http_status:404

loglevel: info
logfile: /var/log/cloudflared.log
metrics: 0.0.0.0:2000
```

---

### `/etc/systemd/system/cloudflared.service`

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Cloudflare Tunnel
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=root
ExecStart=/usr/bin/cloudflared tunnel --config /etc/cloudflared/config.yml run --token eyJhIjoiNzUwNDc0OTRmMzU3ZTY3YTkwZmM5ZTEwZTkyZDQ2YTAiLCJ0IjoiMGNmY2M4OTQtNWVhMi00YTgxLTk5NmYtNzJlMDk0ODhlZGI0IiwicyI6Ik56WmpNakl5TldJdE5XTmtNUzAwTVdRNUxXSTVNelV0WWpVNU9ESTFZMlV5T0RZMyJ9
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5s
StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

